Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/sam-rs
Description: Rust (candle) inference for Segment Anything models (CUDA build)
 sam-rs segments images with SAM, MobileSAM, EfficientSAM, SAM 2 and SAM 3,
 locally via candle, with fused CUDA kernels. Model weights are downloaded
 from Hugging Face on first use into ~/.cache/sam-rs. This build is linked
 against CUDA. Needs an NVIDIA GPU with compute capability 8.0+ (Ampere or newer). libcuda1
 (installed by the NVIDIA driver package) satisfies the runtime link; it
 does not by itself guarantee driver/toolkit compatibility.
